WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.370
Picture an economy where factories
have machines standing idle.

2
00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.070
Outside, people who want
work cannot find it.

3
00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.600
Nothing is broken.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.710
And yet, month after month,

5
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.800
nothing changes. So why might
an economy settle at a level

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.330
of spending too low to
give everyone a job?

7
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:23.010
In this mission, you'll draw
a 45-degree line and find

8
00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.430
where spending equals income.

9
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:27.330
Then you'll use a graph lab:

10
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:31.500
change investment and watch
the economy's equilibrium move.

11
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.460
Your mission: find out how
an economy can get stuck,

12
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.750
and what could lift it.
